# Placeholder so CI's checkout carries ota/public/staging/.
#
# `firebase deploy` replaces the whole Hosting release with whatever is in
# ota/public, so a directory that is absent from the checkout is a directory
# that is absent from the deployed site — this is the same failure the note in
# .gitignore describes for the landing pages. Nothing here is secret and
# nothing here is a build artifact: manifest.json and releases/*.apk are
# written into this tree by .github/workflows/ota-publish.yml at publish time
# and are deliberately NOT committed.
